00); see the breakdown below."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at -0.9% over 3 years, 7.5% over 5 years and -0.6% over 10 years, so growth is decelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 15%).","Net reinvestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Forward indicators: FFO growth of 25.7% a year over five years.","Capex runs only 0.7x depreciation (12.4% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.6%), and institutions hold 88%.","Insiders have only bought over the past year (5 purchases, net $50.3M bought).","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.0% (0.1% in buybacks and 3.5% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 4.7% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It pays out 467% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["CEO pay is $2K."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.8785,"ev_ebitda":16.1705,"pfcf":17.849,"pb":1.3551,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.5564,"fcf_margin":0.1712,"div_yield":0.0475}},"ticker":"SVC","date":"2026-11-13"}